@startuml CryptoWeb-state-04-trade-fill
title CryptoWeb - Executed Trade Fill Lifecycle

!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 65
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam StateFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
hide empty description

state "FILLED" as Filled
state "REVERSED" as Reversed

[*] --> Filled : market-price settlement committed
Filled --> Reversed : authorized reversal / compensating updates

note right of Filled
  Records an executed simulated trade.
  Ledger commitment may occur later;
  it is tracked using ledger pointers,
  not through an extra trade status.
end note

note right of Reversed
  Reversal is permitted only after
  business and balance checks. The
  system creates a compensating wallet
  transaction and keeps the trade for
  audit history.
end note

@enduml
